<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telesp posts Q1 profit rise.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telesp posts Q1 profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo state telecom company Telesp issued the following first quarter results calculated according to Brazilian Generally Accepted Accounting Prinicples (GAAP).</p>
<p>			 Jan-March 1997	    Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Net		     213.3 million		   178 million</p>
<p>    Gross revenues	 1.32 bln		  1.09 bln</p>
<p>    Net/1,000 shrs	 4.01			3.49</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais. Telesp said net profit increased 19.8 percent.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
